  "body": "Positioned on Ascension Crescent, this 239m² freehold section offers a rare chance to secure land in one of Orewa’s most desirable streets. Sections in this area do not come up often, and when they do, they don’t sit long — so if you’re serious, act quickly.\r\n\r\nThis site gives you the freedom to design a home that truly fits your lifestyle. You’re surrounded by quality homes and a friendly neighbourhood, with easy access to everything that makes Orewa so popular:\r\n\r\n• Short distance to Orewa School and Orewa College\r\n\r\n• Easy transport links for commuting\r\n\r\n• Minutes to Orewa Beach, local cafés, restaurants, and shopping\r\n\r\n• A relaxed coastal lifestyle with all conveniences close by.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are limited. If you want to build in a prime location with strong long-term value, this section is worth your attention.\r\n\r\nContact me today to secure it before someone else does.",
